 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Cyber/privacy/technology-law internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"AI policy/privacy/responsible-AI internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"AI governance / technology policy / public policy internship"}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","High-Value Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"AI Company"},{"text":"AI governance, privacy, risk"}],[{"text":"Technology Company"},{"text":"Tech law, contracts, compliance"}],[{"text":"Consulting Firm"},{"text":"Policy + governance + analytics"}],[{"text":"Think Tank"},{"text":"Research + policy writing"}],[{"text":"Law Firm"},{"text":"Tech law + legal research"}],[{"text":"Government"},{"text":"Policy + regulatory analysis"}],[{"text":"NGO"},{"text":"Digital rights + policy advocacy"}],[{"text":"International Organization"},{"text":"International policy + technology"}],[{"text":"Big Tech Policy Team"},{"text":"AI regulation + stakeholder management"}],[{"text":"Responsible AI Team"},{"text":"AI risk + governance"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize certifications and courses in:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI fundamentals"},{"text":"Machine learning fundamentals"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"LLM fundamentals"},{"text":"AI safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"AI risk management"},{"text":"Model governance"},{"text":"AI auditing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Law"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology law"},{"text":"Cyber law"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Privacy law"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Technology contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Regulatory policy"},{"text":"Technology policy"},{"text":"Digital governance"},{"text":"Policy research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python fundamentals"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy writing"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"}]}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An LL.M is useful but not mandatory for every AI-policy position."},{"type":"h","text":"Law-focused"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LL.M Technology Law"},{"text":"LL.M Cyber Law"},{"text":"LL.M Intellectual Property"},{"text":"LL.M Data Protection/Privacy"},{"text":"LL.M International Law"},{"text":"LL.M Corporate/Commercial Law"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Policy-focused"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MA Public Policy"},{"text":"MA International Relations"},{"text":"Master's in Technology Policy"},{"text":"Master's in Digital Governance"},{"text":"Master's in Public Administration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology-focused"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master's in AI"},{"text":"MSc Data Science"},{"text":"MSc Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Technology Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a law graduate, a particularly powerful combination is:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"LLB"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Technology Law"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI Governance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Public Policy"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, the associate can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI Governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Governance Specialist"},{"text":"AI Governance Manager"},{"text":"Responsible AI Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Technology Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Policy Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Privacy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Privacy Specialist"},{"text":"Data Protection Specialist"},{"text":"Privacy Policy Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Responsible AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Responsible AI Specialist"},{"text":"AI Ethics Specialist"},{"text":"Algorithmic Accountability Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Regulatory Affairs Specialist"},{"text":"Technology Regulatory Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Regulation Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Public Policy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Public Policy Associate"},{"text":"Digital Governance Specialist"},{"text":"Technology Policy Consultant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Compliance Specialist"},{"text":"AI Risk Analyst"},{"text":"AI Governance Consultant"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Experience","Typical Position"],"rows":[[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Policy Intern / Research Assistant"}],[{"text":"1–3 years"},{"text":"Junior Policy Analyst"}],[{"text":"2–5 years"},{"text":"AI Policy Associate"}],[{"text":"4–7 years"},{"text":"Senior AI Policy Associate"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"AI Governance / Policy Manager"}],[{"text":"8–12 years"},{"text":"AI Policy Lead"}],[{"text":"10–15+ years"},{"text":"Director – AI Policy / Responsible AI"}],[{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Head of AI Governance / Technology Policy"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual progression depends on organization, specialization, research/publication record and policy experience."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technology Areas","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The future AI Policy Associate should monitor:"},{"type":"h","text":"Generative AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foundation models"},{"text":"LLMs"},{"text":"Multimodal AI"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Synthetic media"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model evaluations"},{"text":"Red teaming"},{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"AI incident management"},{"text":"Safety testing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Model governance"},{"text":"AI audits"},{"text":"Algorithmic impact assessments"},{"text":"AI risk management"},{"text":"Responsible AI"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital regulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Platform regulation"},{"text":"Digital competition"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Digital identity"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Sector-specific AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare AI"},{"text":"Financial AI"},{"text":"Education AI"},{"text":"Legal AI"},{"text":"Government AI"},{"text":"Autonomous systems"}]}]},{"heading":"AI Policy Research Workflow","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional policy associate should be able to move from a technology development to a policy recommendation."},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology Development","Identify Social / Economic Impact","Identify Stakeholders","Identify Legal Issues","Research Existing Regulation","Identify Regulatory Gaps","Assess Risks","Compare Policy Options","Evaluate Economic / Social Impact","Recommend Policy","Draft Policy Brief","Stakeholder Consultation","Implementation","Monitoring"]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile at Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong candidate should graduate with four complementary capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Legal capability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology law"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Cyber law"},{"text":"Intellectual property"},{"text":"Contracts"},{"text":"Regulatory research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. AI capability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ML fundamentals"},{"text":"Generative AI"},{"text":"LLMs"},{"text":"AI lifecycle"},{"text":"AI risks"},{"text":"Model governance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Policy capability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy research"},{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Policy writing"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"text":"Impact assessment"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Business capability"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Technology procurement"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI POLICY ASSOCIATE"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐"},{"text":"│ │ │"},{"text":"LAW AI POLICY"},{"text":"│ │ │"},{"text":"Technology Law ML Fundamentals Policy Research"},{"text":"Privacy Generative AI Policy Analysis"},{"text":"Cyber Law LLMs Policy Writing"},{"text":"IP AI Risk Regulation"},{"text":"Contracts AI Safety Impact Assessment"},{"text":"│ │ │"},{"text":"└──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┘"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"GOVERNANCE"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"AI Risk • Compliance"},{"text":"Data Governance"},{"text":"Accountability"},{"text":"Human Oversight"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"PROFESSIONAL"},{"text":"│"},{"text":"Research • Writing • Communication"},{"text":"Stakeholder Management • Analytics"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For Technology Law / AI Governance → AI Policy Associate, the strongest pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["LLB / Integrated LLB","Technology Law","Privacy + Cyber Law","AI Fundamentals","AI Governance","Policy Research","AI Policy Internship","Policy Analyst/Research Assistant","AI Policy Associate","Senior Associate","AI Governance/Policy Manager","AI Policy Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"The biggest competitive advantage is to avoid becoming only a lawyer who knows AI terminology or only a technology enthusiast who knows policy concepts."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Legal expertise","AI literacy","policy research","governance","risk management","strong policy writing."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"note","label":"Best Overall Positioning","text":"Technology-law graduate with practical AI knowledge, privacy/data-governance expertise, AI-risk assessment capability, policy-writing experience and responsible-AI governance skills."}]}]}